# The Busara toolkit: leveraging behavioral science for development

**Authors:** Chaning Jang, Edel Koki, Robert Nyaga, Arize Okafor, Jaspreet Singh, Steve Wendel

## Abstract
<jats:p>The Busara Toolkit includes a framework (AUDAS), along with specific tools and templates designed to facilitate impactful and efficient projects. Toolkit covers the entire project life cycle from start to finish - i.e. from the very first stage where a project is staffed and kicked off, through the delivery, to the end where a project is closed and signed off with the client and/or partners.  We’ve also added specific deep-dives on qualitative behavioral science, the dynamics and importance of understanding context, and tools for integrating systems analysis with behavioral field work.</jats:p>

**Source:** https://doi.org/10.62372/wqsb6195

